<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-Sunday's second-round playoff results.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-Sunday's second-round playoff results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second-round National Basketball Association playoff games on Sunday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>Eastern Conference semifinals</p>
<p> NEW YORK	   77  Miami		 73</p>
<p>(New York leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p> Chicago	    89  ATLANTA	     80</p>
<p>(Chicago leads best-of-seven series 3-1)</p>
<p>Western Conference semifinal</p>
<p> Houston	   110  SEATTLE	    106 (OT)</p>
<p>(Houston leads best-of-seven series 3-1)</p>
